text.section:
Any electrical conductors and cables installed in or inby the last open crosscut, or within 150 feet of any pillar workings or longwall face, shall be:

Shielded high-voltage cables supplying power to permissible longwall equipment or other equipment;


Interconnecting conductors and cables of permissible longwall equipment;


Conductors and cables of intrinsically safe circuits; or


Cables and conductors supplying power to low-voltage or medium-voltage permissible equipment.
